        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nThe point shown below represents a number on a number line. The absolute value of this number is [MATH: 4.] What is the number?\n\n[IMG: /graphics/5d582147fd8d78c85f93d1c0d92da868]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nThe number is negative because it is to the left of zero.\n\nThe absolute value of the number is [MATH: 4,] so the distance between that number and zero on a number line is [MATH: 4.]\n\nThe negative number at a distance of [MATH: 4] from zero is [MATH: -4,] so the number is [MATH: -4.]\n\n[IMG: /graphics/eb80c5a808a4166ec5dcdabb8d6a63d0]"
