        "readable_text": "Question Graphic:\n[IMG: /graphics/q-61626]\n\nPrompt:\nThe point shown above represents a number on a number line. The absolute value of this number is [MATH: 3.] What is the number?\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: 2]\nb. [MATH: \u2212 2]\nc. [MATH: 4]\nd. [MATH: \u2212 3]\ne. [MATH: 3]"
